<title>USA: Interphase Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Interphase Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>INTERPHASE CORP.</p>
<p>	     Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>			  Three months ended/a  Nine months ended/a</p>
<p>			     Sep 30,  Oct. 31,    Sep 30,  Oct. 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	 1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $16,370   $12,517    $39,565   $36,346</p>
<p> Pretax income (loss)	192     1,103   (10,327)     3,274</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	   167	 763   (10,754)     2,153</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
