<p>and common-equivalent</p>
<p>  shares outstanding     5,709     5,220	4,920     5,051</p>
<p>Effective Jan 1, 1996, Interphase changed its fiscal year-end from Oct. 31 to Dec. 31.  The prior-year financial statements have not been restated to conform to the new fiscal qtr-ends. For purposes of comparative financial-statement reporting, the firm has selected the quarter-end from the prior fiscal year that most closely matches the current-year fiscal quarter-end.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
